#. 犯人は<CLT 9>ジェノサイダー翔<CLT>だ。
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The culprit is <CLT 9>Genocide Jack<CLT>,\n"
"I'm sure of it."
msgstr ""

#. これは決定事項だ。
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Case closed,\n"
"as far as I'm concerned."
msgstr ""

#. そんなの、あり得ないって！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "But...that's impossible!"
msgstr ""

#. なぜ、あり得ない？
msgctxt "0004 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Why? What makes it impossible?"
msgstr ""

#. だって…いくらなんでも…そんな…
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Well, I mean...come on...!"
msgstr ""

#. て言うか、
#. <CLT 9>根拠がない<CLT>じゃん！
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "There's just <CLT 9>no proof for it<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. ところで、ジェノサイダー翔って…
msgctxt "0007 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Hey, so, speaking of Genocide Jack..."
msgstr ""

#. 誰でしたっけ！？
msgctxt "0008 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "I don't know who that is!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>マ、マジかよ…！<CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>S-Seriously!?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>ジェノサイダー翔だと？<CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>It's Genocide Jack!?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そうだ、そうだ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>That's right!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>うむむむむ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Hm-hm-hm...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>俺もそう思うぞ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>I think so, too!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>おいおい…<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Hey, hold on...<CLT>"
msgstr ""
